    {
      "text": "Figure 4: GoTube’s runtime (x-axis) and volume size (y-axis) as a function of the tightness factor µ. Volume was normalized",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        199.12294006347656,
        558.000732421875,
        208.18890380859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "by the volume obtained with the lowest µ (4.3e-13, 2.4e-12, and 2.1e-38 in particular).",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        210.08192443847656,
        399.05914306640625,
        219.14788818359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "behavior. The CT-RNN state vector consists of 16 dimen-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        243.4173583984375,
        292.5046691894531,
        252.32391357421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sions, which is twice as much as existing CT-RNN reacha-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        254.3753662109375,
        292.5046081542969,
        263.28192138671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "bility benchmarks (Gruenbacher et al. 2020).",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        265.3343505859375,
        233.0079345703125,
        274.24090576171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Here, we study how GoTube can trade runtime for the vol-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96297073364258,
        276.2933349609375,
        292.50494384765625,
        285.19989013671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ume of the constructed reachtube through its tightness fac-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        287.2523193359375,
        292.50457763671875,
        296.15887451171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tor µ. In particular, we run GoTube on our newly proposed",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        298.0519104003906,
        292.5016174316406,
        307.11785888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "benchmark with various values of µ. We then plot GoTube’s",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        309.0108947753906,
        292.50140380859375,
        318.07684326171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "runtime (x-axis) and volume size (y-axis) as a function of",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        320.1292724609375,
        292.5046081542969,
        329.03582763671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "µ. The resulting curves show the Pareto-front of runtime-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        330.9288635253906,
        292.5000915527344,
        339.99481201171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "volume trade-off achievable with GoTube.",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        342.0472412109375,
        222.7563934326172,
        350.95379638671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Figure 4 shows the results for a time horizon of 10s in",
      "bbox": [
        63.96297073364258,
        353.0062255859375,
        292.49505615234375,
        361.91278076171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the ﬁrst two examples, and of 2s in the last example. Our",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        363.9642333984375,
        292.5046081542969,
        372.87078857421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "results demonstrate that GoTube can adapt to different run-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        374.9232177734375,
        292.5045166015625,
        383.82977294921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time and tightness constraints and set a new benchmark for",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        385.8822021484375,
        292.5046081542969,
        394.78875732421875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "future methods to compare with.",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        396.8411865234375,
        183.77276611328125,
        405.74774169921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Discussions, Scope and Conclusions",
      "bbox": [
        82.57096862792969,
        417.5637512207031,
        263.9313659667969,
        428.31146240234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We proposed GoTube, a new stochastic veriﬁcation algo-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        432.231201171875,
        292.5046081542969,
        441.13775634765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "rithm that provides robustness guarantees (also safety guar-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        443.190185546875,
        292.504638671875,
        452.09674072265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "antees if a set of states to be avoided is given) for high-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        454.149169921875,
        292.50457763671875,
        463.05572509765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dimensional, time-continuous systems. GoTube is stable and",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        465.108154296875,
        292.50457763671875,
        474.01470947265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "sets the state-of-the-art in terms of its ability to scale to time",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        476.067138671875,
        292.5046081542969,
        484.97369384765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "horizons well beyond what has been previously possible. It",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        487.026123046875,
        292.5045166015625,
        495.93267822265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "also allows a larger perturbation radius for the initial ball,",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        497.985107421875,
        292.5046081542969,
        506.89166259765625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "for which other veriﬁcation methods fail. Lastly, GoTube’s",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        508.944091796875,
        292.5046691894531,
        517.8506469726562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "scalability enables it to readily handle the veriﬁcation of",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        519.902099609375,
        292.5046081542969,
        528.8086547851562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "advanced continuous-depth neural models, a setting where",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        530.861083984375,
        292.504638671875,
        539.7676391601562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "state-of-the-art deterministic approaches fail.",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        541.820068359375,
        233.17735290527344,
        550.7266235351562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SLR versus GoTube? SLR combines symbolic with statis-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        552.6595458984375,
        292.49993896484375,
        561.6856689453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tical reachability techniques. However, no implementation is",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        563.7380981445312,
        292.5045166015625,
        572.6446533203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "available to date. For comparison purposes, we implemented",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        574.6970825195312,
        292.5045471191406,
        583.6036376953125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SLR on our own and observed that while it does not blow up",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        585.6561279296875,
        292.50457763671875,
        594.5626831054688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "in space, it blows up in time. As a consequence, we were",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        596.6151123046875,
        292.50457763671875,
        605.5216674804688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "not able to use SLR to construct reachtubes for our high-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        607.5740966796875,
        292.5045471191406,
        616.4806518554688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "dimensional benchmarks.",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        618.5330810546875,
        155.8276824951172,
        627.4396362304688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sample blow up in GoTube? As a pure Monte-Carlo tech-",
      "bbox": [
        53.999961853027344,
        629.3724975585938,
        292.49688720703125,
        638.3986206054688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "nique, the number of samples N to be taken depends on both",
      "bbox": [
        53.999969482421875,
        640.2906494140625,
        292.5005187988281,
        649.3566284179688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the conﬁdence coefﬁcient λ and the tightness coefﬁcient µ",
      "bbox": [
        53.99995422363281,
        651.2496948242188,
        292.50439453125,
        660.315673828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "as well as on the system’s dimensionality. As a consequence,",
      "bbox": [
        53.99995422363281,
        662.3681030273438,
        292.5046081542969,
        671.274658203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "for very small values of these coefﬁcients, the number of",
      "bbox": [
        53.99995422363281,
        673.3270874023438,
        292.504638671875,
        682.233642578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "samples tends to blow up. The goal of symbolic techniques",
      "bbox": [
        53.99995422363281,
        684.2861328125,
        292.5044860839844,
        693.1926879882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is exactly the one to avoid such a blowup. However, in our",
      "bbox": [
